---
import { url } from '../../lib/url'
---

<section class="safe container" aria-labelledby="safe-title">
  <h2 id="safe-title">Safe on production</h2>
  <p class="lede">Look around a live system without changing it.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <h3>Read-only mode</h3>
      <p>Turn it on for a connection and the studio refuses every change to it.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Audit log</h3>
      <p>Every change you make is recorded, so you can see what was done and when.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>No consumer needed</h3>
      <p>Browse messages straight from the stream. Nothing is acknowledged and no consumer is created.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href={url('/docs/connections/')}>How read-only mode works</a></p>
</section>

<style>
  .safe {
    padding-block: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .lede {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  li {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--ok);
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
  }
  li p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
